Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.68,0:01:17.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直憧憬著理莎能夠成為我的女朋友 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.95,0:01:19.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起享受甜蜜的高中生活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.27,0:01:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不了多久 我就會向你告白
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.51,0:01:25.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜歡你 請和我交往
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.10,0:01:27.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等待你的回覆
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.09,0:01:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.33,0:01:43.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事 反正是人情巧克力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.20,0:01:45.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 人情巧克力啦
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.94,0:02:04.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[親！早就喜歡上你了]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.00,0:02:12.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都升高二了 你還是白痴一樣地打哈欠嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.68,0:02:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要你管 沒聽說過冬眠不覺曉嗎 笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.92,0:02:18.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼冬眠啊 應該是春眠不覺曉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 好像是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.39,0:02:22.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是個白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴 你這大圖騰
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.29,0:02:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是是 是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.17,0:02:30.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這水蚤也長大點了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.51,0:02:31.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.52,0:02:38.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰來救救我
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.07,0:02:39.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.23,0:02:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來來 狗狗 不可以這樣哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.09,0:02:47.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖 乖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是陸奧五郎嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}（陸奧五郎：日本動物學家。著有多本關於犬類的書籍。）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.43,0:02:53.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可是男生哦　一定要對女孩子溫柔點哦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.84,0:02:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全不懂如何和女孩子交往 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:00.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是應付男孩子倒是個天才嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.75,0:03:02.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 他是隻公狗呀 對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:05.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,應付男孩子是個天才
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.09,0:03:11.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,ByeBye
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.24,0:03:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是謝謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什麼名字
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.43,0:03:21.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姓名是什麼無所謂啦 走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.21,0:03:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜歡上他了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.98,0:03:37.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼都聚在那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.70,0:03:40.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 是分班的告示
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.25,0:03:43.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 我們還同班哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.13,0:03:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:48.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我被分到隔壁班去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.78,0:03:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是千春 你跟鈴木同班耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:52.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.81,0:03:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.07,0:03:59.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:02.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.70,0:04:03.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欸？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.15,0:04:03.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們同班…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.24,0:04:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好甜蜜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:10.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,親愛的 我們還是同班耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎 真開心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小信
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:16.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,親愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.02,0:04:24.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然還跟小泉同班
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.88,0:04:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要到何時才能擺脫[ALL阪神·巨人]的命運
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:31.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你再長高點再說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.46,0:04:32.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴 你才該變矮
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.16,0:04:34.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少說這種不可能的事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:38.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖說還是老樣子 今年好像有點不同
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,導師還是那老頭 一定是他做的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.99,0:04:44.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原本是我天敵的大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.35,0:04:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在在我心中竟佔有微妙的一席之地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.99,0:04:52.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞不好 我對大谷…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:04:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不 不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.32,0:04:59.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:00.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.21,0:05:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隔壁班有個名字好眼熟哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:07.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿遙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:09.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不了多久 我就會向你告白
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.29,0:05:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜歡你 請和我交往
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:14.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.85,0:05:20.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真遺憾啊 我走啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.63,0:05:21.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這個叛徒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,情人節收到的是人情巧克力也就罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.73,0:05:28.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本以為該忍的都忍了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.12,0:05:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰知居然不能跟理莎同班
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.39,0:05:34.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 差點忘了你有說過四月會轉來的了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.38,0:05:36.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差點忘了？ 原來是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.42,0:05:40.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道 難道理莎已經忘了我了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.55,0:05:43.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒這回事 我怎麼敢忘了你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.12,0:05:46.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙人 你一定忘了 你真過分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的沒有啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.55,0:05:50.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.66,0:05:52.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走啦 開學典禮要開始囉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:53.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:56.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿遙 就這樣 過會見
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:00.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.88,0:06:03.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這叛徒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.55,0:06:04.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放手 巨人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.72,0:06:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是不想打擾你們
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰要你多管閒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.78,0:06:10.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是老樣子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真精彩的相聲
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.51,0:06:13.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還真是有默契
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.87,0:06:22.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又要和大谷同班一年了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.68,0:06:30.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是同一個人 就是這個學長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.81,0:06:39.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我們得選出擔任雜七雜八職務的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.78,0:06:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但為了省事 我們先選出班級幹部就好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:44.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他的都交給班級幹部決定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:46.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.88,0:06:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 那就請…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.58,0:06:51.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,絕對不要看那個老頭 小泉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.11,0:06:52.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.79,0:06:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 那就請正很有默契地用眼神在交流的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小泉和大谷擔任吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:00.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:02.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贊成的人舉手
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.82,0:07:04.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贊成
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:05.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.80,0:07:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:07.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就這麼決定 
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:09.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜兩位 支持率100%
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.97,0:07:12.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新官上任 雖然緊了點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.28,0:07:14.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待會要舉行一年級的入學典禮
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:16.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們快去幫忙準備吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.69,0:07:17.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.14,0:07:19.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真厲害 他們好有默契啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.19,0:07:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他們兩個就是1年2班被稱為[ALL阪神·巨人]的人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.26,0:07:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 隨他們去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.30,0:07:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼 你又要當叛徒嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.42,0:07:36.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就想成繼去年之後連任吧 就照做囉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走啦 大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.76,0:07:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.80,0:07:59.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,社團活動
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.49,0:08:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吹牛吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:05.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,現在正在舉行入學典禮 哪裡有社團活動
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.47,0:08:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是 是練習公演
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.65,0:08:11.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,應該去幫忙入學典禮 想蹺掉嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.86,0:08:13.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我現在沒空去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.93,0:08:14.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.08,0:08:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從今年起我就成為籃球社正式隊員 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.82,0:08:19.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要上場比賽了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.23,0:08:20.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:25.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真的 春假中決定的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.48,0:08:28.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很厲害喔 2年級只有他一個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.25,0:08:30.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰要你多嘴的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:33.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下任隊長超級候選人No.1
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.26,0:08:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要多嘴啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:52.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說起來 大谷真的很努力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.13,0:08:54.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明開心得不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.86,0:08:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我也沒辦法了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是兩碼事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.20,0:09:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不爽 真不爽 你這女人真是煩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:15.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少囉嗦 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.59,0:09:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還不是你 答應接下班級幹部的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.28,0:09:23.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身為男人在那種情況下能不答應嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.77,0:09:27.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你為了耍酷把我拖下水
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.57,0:09:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可知道給我添了多大麻煩
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.15,0:09:30.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很吵哎 巨大圖騰
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴 水蚤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.63,0:09:35.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 大家辛苦了 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.11,0:09:38.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 結束了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.27,0:09:43.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 你在等我呀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:44.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.10,0:09:48.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看你看 一年級的已經陸續進場了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.53,0:09:51.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都穿著挺刮的制服
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.61,0:09:52.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好新的感覺哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.07,0:09:58.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了小信 入學典禮時你穿的衣服超可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.53,0:09:59.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把老師氣得半死呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為那時還沒拿到制服啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:05.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還沒拿到制服？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.18,0:10:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算入學典禮不穿制服，也要穿件整齊點的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,雖然有但…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.84,0:10:17.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為人家昨天買了件超可愛的T恤
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.11,0:10:21.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要趕快穿上它出門嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.11,0:10:23.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.12,0:10:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以為說對不起就可以了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.58,0:10:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 很可愛對不對
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.11,0:10:30.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算可愛 也不可以今天穿來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.21,0:10:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,應該著裝整齊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.07,0:10:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 好可憐 一開學就被盯上 
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.69,0:10:38.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.75,0:10:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.18,0:10:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那美眉挺搞怪的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.02,0:10:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.61,0:10:48.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 這樣我的面子何在
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.81,0:10:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.50,0:10:53.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我說 等我像老師這麼老的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.15,0:10:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不能穿這麼可愛的衣服啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:59.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不趁年輕趕快穿的話 就要變歐巴桑了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:03.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說誰是歐巴桑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.85,0:11:06.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 沒什麼 我不是在說老師哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.65,0:11:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:13.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師 不好了 那邊有男生在打架
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.66,0:11:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不得了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.06,0:11:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙你的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.41,0:11:22.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,學姐是今天早上的…？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.54,0:11:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.12,0:11:30.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們認識嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.00,0:11:32.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.07,0:11:34.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 剛剛你說騙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:39.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 那老師很固執的 你最好小心一點
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:41.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慘的話 可以對你說教說上一個小時呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.17,0:11:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.22,0:11:47.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.97,0:11:50.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪裡哪裡 別客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.75,0:11:55.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.72,0:12:00.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 小泉 我要走了 可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.94,0:12:03.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:31.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼要我陪你去買衣服啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.56,0:12:35.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,決不能輸給新生
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:40.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什麼關係啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.91,0:12:42.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用不著為了這點小事產生敵意吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.19,0:12:43.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有關係
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.35,0:12:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 可是 你還真有錢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.97,0:12:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為我每天晚上都幫媽媽按摩肩膀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:01.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個護腕 應該很適合大谷哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:05.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是白痴啊 那又怎樣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:07.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,從今年起我就成為籃球社正式隊員 
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:09.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要上場比賽了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.77,0:13:15.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.67,0:13:18.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,店員正盯著你看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要買這個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼東西
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:30.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真沒禮貌 這是我送給你的禮物
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:33.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼禮物 會帶來不幸的禮物嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:35.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,陷阱 一定是陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.02,0:13:40.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要我上次在二手CD店買的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.26,0:13:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,附有海坊主簽名的CD 對不對
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.82,0:13:45.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我決不會給你的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.28,0:13:46.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.90,0:13:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本想慶祝你成為籃球隊正式隊員的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.79,0:13:51.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要就還我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.67,0:13:52.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦 真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.78,0:13:54.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙你的 我戴一定很好看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 真好看 很帥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.15,0:13:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.54,0:14:02.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帥吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.94,0:14:06.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還可以
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝啦 我收下囉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.55,0:14:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒想到你也會這麼好心
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:14.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是心血來潮而已
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.06,0:14:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理莎 你怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:24.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是在想 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.16,0:14:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先不說身高 我的性格本身也有問題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.23,0:14:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.21,0:14:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好希望自己能變得可愛一點
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.73,0:14:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,變可愛？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.99,0:14:35.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:39.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎麼了 突然說出這種好像戀愛中少女說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.10,0:14:41.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欸 有嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.95,0:14:42.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.13,0:14:45.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真傷腦筋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:46.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,學姐
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:50.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,學姐好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.94,0:14:52.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,入學典禮時的事 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:54.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.51,0:14:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不妙 可能有血光之災
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.07,0:15:03.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 學姐你的手鐲好可愛 哪裡買的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊？這個啊 這件是在…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:07.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們夠了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:09.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這孩子真乖
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:12.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對了 有什麼事情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,學姐你們有參加社團活動嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:19.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:21.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有想參加的社團嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:25.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為明天體育館會有社團介紹
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.61,0:15:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想看了再決定
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.89,0:15:31.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,親愛的說他要演黑衣人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.13,0:15:34.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑衣人？籃球社到底要介紹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:37.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 聽說大谷也會上去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.37,0:15:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽起來好像很有趣耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.89,0:15:44.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我會認真看籃球社的介紹的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.26,0:15:46.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.46,0:15:51.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,世界上有這麼可愛的女生
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.75,0:15:54.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,為什麼我卻偏偏生成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.26,0:15:57.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,神哪 你太偏心了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.31,0:16:11.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蹺課去看 沒關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.86,0:16:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係 反正是自習嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.59,0:16:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且只有介紹社團的人可以不用上課 真過分
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:21.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很想看親愛的演的黑衣人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.18,0:16:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑衣人到底是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.50,0:16:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.53,0:16:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,游泳部介紹完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下來是男子籃球社
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.78,0:16:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前本籃球社共有11名成員
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.16,0:16:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,常常打進地區決賽 是非常優秀的社團
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.73,0:16:39.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然 初學者我們也非常歡迎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:42.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打不好的人加入後一定也可以打得好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.15,0:16:46.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中尾和大谷在哪呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.00,0:16:49.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好奇怪哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.75,0:16:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各位同學 請看後面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.05,0:16:58.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那邊的小個子同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.76,0:17:05.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是大谷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.32,0:17:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加入本社後 竟變得會飛身灌籃了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:17.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請看
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.42,0:17:32.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,orz
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.28,0:17:34.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 熱烈鼓掌
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.07,0:17:36.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.33,0:17:38.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.69,0:17:42.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是敗給他們了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.32,0:17:45.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊 我不想看到我男朋友這麼遜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.24,0:17:49.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看 連這種矮冬瓜都可以灌籃
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.62,0:17:51.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽一定會很高興的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.31,0:17:53.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說誰是矮冬瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.11,0:17:59.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男子籃球社期待大家的加入
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.15,0:18:01.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,身高不是問題
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.80,0:18:03.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,矮個子同學也可以加入哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.79,0:18:14.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.04,0:18:22.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.97,0:18:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你們剛剛在耍什麼寶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:35.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也來看了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.48,0:18:42.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 小信到現在還沒從打擊中恢復過來
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:43.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我覺得還挺好玩的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:44.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一點也不好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.76,0:18:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,誰理她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:48.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們為了徵集社員都很拚命
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.47,0:18:50.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因為指導老師太兇 走了很多人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.88,0:18:52.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以最好一開始多招點人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:56.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用那麼遜的方式 招得到人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:57.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.87,0:18:59.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一點也不遜
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.32,0:19:10.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是上次那個學妹
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.37,0:19:16.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,開學典禮那天 你幫忙趕狗的那個
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不記得我了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.32,0:19:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用在意 這傢伙是個白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.72,0:19:26.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你討打啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.99,0:19:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係的 
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.66,0:19:34.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,學長剛剛飛身灌籃 好帥喔
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:37.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽到沒 人家剛剛說的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.47,0:19:39.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.48,0:19:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是2年3班的大谷敦士
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.48,0:19:54.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.28,0:19:59.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是1年4班的壽壽聖子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.92,0:20:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聖子呀 好可愛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.96,0:20:07.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.40,0:20:39.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就喜歡上你了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.69,0:20:44.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃！？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.80,0:20:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.31,0:20:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的身體反應總是比腦子慢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.66,0:20:59.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 是比腦子快
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.35,0:21:01.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你討厭我了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 那倒不會 
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.15,0:21:13.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我這麼做好像有點先斬後奏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以的話 我們可以先從朋友開始交往嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.95,0:21:32.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.23,0:21:37.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇 我好高興哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.90,0:21:43.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是什麼狀況啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.06,0:23:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真是個邪惡的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.89,0:23:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然一瞬間讓聖子墜入愛河
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.75,0:23:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惡 你給我適可而止
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.56,0:23:35.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戀愛情結 love com 次回
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.48,0:23:37.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打跑禁忌之愛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.77,0:23:38.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要看噢
